From 3d307aed3548ac034447f9e26d877e226549e211 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: fi3 <you@example.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 11:13:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] ADD provider-neutral backend command routing so slash
 chats bypass ordinary sends

Selected-agent slash-prefixed chat messages route through an AgentBackend command hook, allowing providers such as Codex to execute app-server actions without prompt injection or ordinary model turns. Providers that do not support commands return a visible backend response through the default hook.
